  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AfDB 7th General Capital Increase GCI 7</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As shareholder in the AfDB, Norway has committed to take part in the AfDB&#x2019;s 7th General Capital Increase (GCI-7), which was approved by the Board of Governors in October 2019. Shareholders participate with both paid-in capital as well as callable capital. The PTA agreement covers the paid-in portion that Norway has committed to. Norway&#x2019;s payment schedule is aligned with the standard payment schedule for non-regional member countries and middle income regional member countries. Commitments are made in the bank&#x2019;s currency, Units of Accounts (corresponds with IMF&#x2019;s Special Drawing Rights - SDR).</narrative>
  </description>
